    "G_DISCRIM": "EQUAL learned V on all options -> lesion NEUTRAL (choice agreement ~1.0). Value-SPECIFIC.",
    "G_PERMUTE": "permute which option gets which learned V (deterministic permutation-average) -> chance.",
    "non_circular_value": "corr(learned V, salience) ~ 0 -> the choice is driven by the learned value, not a relabeled salience.",
    "moat_by_construction": "the WTA decision organ has NO RF/conversational slices -> array-disjoint from any composer; check_moat re-asserted on the merged critic agent."
